cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Code and computed values for the vanishing of eta^11 modulo 13 along quadratic residue classes"
abstract: >-
  Measures how often the Fourier coefficients of eta^11 vanish modulo 13, and
  how that frequency depends on quadratic residue classes. Computes a(m) mod 13
  for all m <= 10^10, measures the excess density of vanishing along squarefree
  kernels and its cumulative count exponent, and the factorisation of the
  Legendre-class dependence over 2260 auxiliary primes. Includes independent
  reimplementations, structural invariants, and a negative result for the
  Shimura lift at every level dividing 288.
authors:
